registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
@banbolee:registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/

# The DSH dependency family is pinned to ONE prerelease (AGENTS.md: `@deepseek-ai/*`
# ^0.2.0-rc.1). A caret range on a prerelease drifts to the newest rc.x the moment
# upstream publishes one — that is how the repository first landed on 0.1.5-rc.3
# while its manifests still said rc.2, and it broke the family-coherence assertion.
# The root `pnpm.overrides` block therefore pins every `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` package
# in the graph; keep that list complete, because a package left out of it is free
# to drift again.
#
# The 0.1.5 -> 0.1.7 migration dropped three names from that list because they no
# longer exist upstream at 0.1.7-rc.2 (`npm view <pkg>@0.1.7-rc.2` -> 404):
#   dsh-code-runtime, dsh-code-runtime-worker-thread  (last 0.1.5-rc.3; the code
#     runtime seat is now `dsh-ptc-runtime` / `dsh-ptc-runtime-node`)
#   dsh-agent-presets  (last 0.1.6-alpha.2; the 0.1.7 roster seat moved to
#     `dsh-agent-preset` + `dsh-agent-preset-registry`, which `plugins/agents`
#     declares and the root `pnpm.overrides` list pins like the rest of the family)
